{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Radical Zomboarding is a roguelike snowboarding game that's all about shredding powder and shooting zombies. Do tricks, buy perks, build your loadout, speed through the snow, and soak the slopes with blood!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547050/extras/3.gif?t=1741742596\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you like going fast? Getting big air? Shooting zombies? <i>Unhinged loading screen tips?</i> <strong>Radical Zomboarding</strong> has it all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Demo Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic mode: Roguelike snowboarding where you buy perks, shoot zombies, dodge missiles, complete challenges, and survive as long as you can!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A small selection of characters, boards, and hats from the full game you can unlock!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One slope from the full game that you can ride down!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>And yes, it runs on the Steam Deck!</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547050?t=1741742596","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547050?t=1741742596","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547050/b77ddd1ea6cf6d16ee90f3fa5fa24a2b3dd0c60a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741742596","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547050/b77ddd1ea6cf6d16ee90f3fa5fa24a2b3dd0c60a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741742596","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":